Instruction on how you created the tools isolation for this product.
Please include platform you installed on, where you installed it, what
you copied where, etc.:

Downloaded the 2.2 project from the site. Fixes were made and sent back to
Phil.  Project was built.  The classes and source code from the build were
put in a file called jsengine-eclipse-22.zip.  The built jar is called ibmjs.jar.
There is an L3 process for updating this JAR file in the TDI dev teamroom tht we follow.
The following files were checked into the adks/ibm/jsengine/2.2 in cmvc:
	jsengine-eclipse-22.zip
	ibmjs.jar
	readme.bteam

Update History (Use only if you have to actually make more changes after the product
has been used in a tools tree build.  Should be rare) :
-----------------
Changed the following files:
ASTFor.java - Added a check for null
ASTWhile.java - Added a check for null
JSContext.java - Use WeakHashMap instead of SystemCache for caching
FBSNumber.java - convert an integer to a java.lang.Integer instead of a java.lang.Double

The changed files are in the file changes.zip.
Compare them to the files in jsengine-eclipse-22.zip to see the changes.

Checked in a new ibmjs.jar with the changed classes.
--------------- Jan 24, 2013 ---------------------------
Also changed the following files:
com/ibm/jscript/ASTTree/binaryop/ASTBinaryAdd.java: Added a line to normalize objects.
com/ibm/jscript/std/ArrayPrototype.java: Rewrote the splice() method.
com/ibm/jscript/types/FBSGlobalObject: The eval() method should also work on Strings returned from Java methods.
com/ibm/jscript/std/RegExpJDK14.java: The match() method should work properly with the g (global) flag.

The changed files are in the file changes.zip.
Compare them to the files in jsengine-eclipse-22.zip to see the changes.

Checked in a new ibmjs.jar with the changed classes.
--------------- Mar 6, 2013 ------------------------
Also changed
com/ibm/jscript/types/JavaAccessObject.java: Bad synchronization might cause constructor to not be found
--------------- Nov 4, 2013 ------------------------
com/ibm/jscript/JSContext.java - Use a WeakReference as the value in the WeakHashMap, to avoid referencing the key.
--------------- Sep 4, 2014 ------------------------
com/ibm/jscript/ASTTree/ASTWhile.java - Fixed a typo, to be able to use continue statement in while loops
--------------- Mar 19, 2019 -----------------------
com/ibm/jscript/std/StringPrototype.java - Added optional parameter to toLocaleLowerCase() and toLocaleUpperCase()
--------------- Aug 13, 2019 -----------------------
com/ibm/jscript/std/DateObject.java - Changed toISOString() to conform to ISO 8601, as in ECMAScript 5.1, section 15.9.1.15.
--------------- Oct 15, 2019 -----------------------
com/ibm/jscript/types/JavaAccessObject.java: In ClassInfoCache, treat Entry as a Map, to avoid storing null for unknown keys.
